OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for grooming
OL,4,A'vulnerable' teenage girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FA married man who groomed a
OL,7,F"vulnerable" teenage girl for months
OL,8,Fbefore booking her into hotels for sex
OL,9,Fhas been jailed for 11 years.
OL,11,FShoaib Mohammed made contact with the
OL,12,Fgirl on Snapchat when he knew she was
OL,13,F14, then after encouraging her to send
OL,14,Fsexualised images, arranged for her to
OL,15,Fleave home in Leicester and meet him in
OL,16,FSheffield, where he took her to hotels
OL,17,Ffor sex.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
