OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for grooming
OL,4,A'vulnerable' teenage girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 34-year-old, from Sheffield, had
OL,7,Fpleaded guilty to five counts of sexual
OL,8,Factivity with a child, one count of
OL,9,Fcausing or inciting a child to engage
OL,10,Fin sexual activity, and three counts of
OL,11,Fpossessing indecent images of a child.
OL,13,FHe was sentenced at Leicester Crown
OL,14,FCourt on Thursday.
